{"ID":"20240118151301-qmff9ug","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151301-qmff9ug","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151301-qmff9ug\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151301-zmn2kql\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129170600-snj041b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:569,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240129170600-snj041b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"088姑活（冬葵子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240129170610"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151301-zmn2kql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151301-zmn2kql","updated":"20240122102354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味甘温，主大风邪气，湿痹寒痛。久服轻身益寿耐老，一名冬葵子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102357-y0ewmq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102357-y0ewmq7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102358-vx9peq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102358-vx9peq7"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】冬葵子及叶，根味皆甘，性滑。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102400-a46i80o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102400-a46i80o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】为冷滑解热药，主滑胎易产，治热痢，通尿疗淋。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102401-6kpv9yu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102401-6kpv9yu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗妇人乳内闭。肿痛，根治恶疮疗淋，利小便。解蜀椒毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102403-xegws9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102403-xegws9l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】冬葵苗煮汁服利小肠，治时行黄病，干叶为末及烧灰服治金疮出血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102406-9cdpatr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102406-9cdpatr"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【思邈】此脾之菜也，宜脾，利胃气，滑大肠。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102407-cvflola","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102407-cvflola"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一钱至三钱，大剂一两。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102409-3apeewu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102409-3apeewu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】无。可做菜肴。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102410-zhddtim","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102410-zhddtim"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【附方】肉锥怪疾——手足忽长倒生肉刺，痛不可忍，但食冬葵叶即可。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102415-0kyvg6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102415-0kyvg6h"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"消中尿多——尿崩，日夜尿七八升。冬葵根浓煎。每日平旦服二升。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102432-ba31vhv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102432-ba31vhv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"妊妇下血——葵子水煎服，日三。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102435-kdpr9l4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102435-kdpr9l4","updated":"20240122102501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"妊妇水肿——小便不利，身重，恶寒，起即头眩。冬葵子，茯苓等分为末，饮服方寸匕，日三，小便利即愈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102449-0mly7gn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102449-0mly7gn","updated":"20240122102453"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":" 胎死腹中，葵子为末，酒服方寸匕，口噤不开者，灌之即生。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122102501-ub36tl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102501-ub36tl0"}},{"ID":"20240122102502-qaejvqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102502-qaejvqx","updated":"20240129170209"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第88味药，姑活。讲姑活的时候很多人还不了解，就是冬葵，冬葵子，姑活，你们传阅一下。那这个呢，一般来说就是寒痛，肢痛关节的痛，你看主治是，解热冷滑解热的药，滑胎，就是胎儿难产不下，我们可以用冬葵。"}]},{"ID":"20240122102514-9zx5div","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102514-9zx5div","updated":"20240129170557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用姑活，这个能够助产。我们过去中医呢，这个女孩子第一胎的时候生完，妇女生完小孩以后喂母乳，喂母乳说，诶，奶排不出来，那有很多奶水，就奶头那边那个孔窍没有开，奶水排不出来，小孩子在哭，吸又吸不出来，那你又急着喂奶，奶又排不出来，怎么处理，这个冬葵，冬葵很好效果。当然呢，我们过去的民间方很多，有一种速度最快的，怎么速度快呢，那个葱啊，葱不是有葱白嘛，不一定是要三星葱，葱白，葱须，然后你切一段葱白的地方，葱白，须须，你拿那个葱白，在乳头那边涂一下，反过来须须又把它刷一刷，砰，马上奶水就喷出来了，速度就那么快，因为它是辛香发散的，葱白是辛，那是我们通脉身体上的大葱、青葱，那这个葱在涂完，那个葱须清一清它，马上奶水就出来，当然你可以再去煮冬葵呀，你要记得擦干净，不然小孩子吃到不是奶是葱，辣死了，我不要吃哦，抗议，一吃他哭，然后你就不知道了为什么喂小孩子吃奶小孩子哭，你每次用葱在那边通，葱很辣嘛，小孩子不懂。所以当医生，当妇女，孕妇也要有一点commonsense(常识)，所以方法很多。那后面的经验方呢，复方呢，诸位可以自己参考一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240122102520-sj6k2wq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122102520-sj6k2wq","updated":"20240129170610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"孙思邈讲的最好，这个冬葵呢是脾的菜，我们用那个菜苗，冬葵的苗来煮菜，是专门给脾脏补脾的，利胃气滑大肠，所以过去呢，冬葵叶子我们可以拿来入菜炒菜，健脾的利肠胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240129170600-snj041b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240129170600-snj041b"}}]}